// Oathbound roster (the fifth faction, a human kingdom of the Reach that keeps faith
// with the dead Titan): every building, unit, summon, hero and Oaths Pledge, with
// first-pass numbers copied from the nearest existing regiment. Format and fields:
// the header of data/rosters/ember_clans.ron. Design: docs/39-oathbound.md.
//
// Data-only first pass (no change to the simulation, SIM_VERSION or the wire format):
//  - The Oaths meter bakes as the Honor meter's machinery (the Court of Oaths earns
//    like an Ancestor Shrine); the screen and the roster call it Oaths.
//  - Sworn Stand is the existing discipline trait (+15% standing still) on foot
//    regiments, with no Oaths cost for leaving it yet.
//  - Economy A (carry and store): Seedtenders carry Grub to the Rootwatch Hall, a
//    Hearthhouse or a Grove. Growing Groves (economy B) need new simulation state.
//  - The Crown Wall reuses the Stones twist; its morale twist needs new simulation.
//  - Oath of the Wall is listed but not built (it needs a new power effect).
